#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:10
msgid "Support status"
msgstr "支持状态"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:12
msgid "Documented stable workflow"
msgstr "已文档化的稳定工作流"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:14
msgid ""
"This documentation treats the following path as the stable core for the "
"current source tree:"
msgstr "本文档将以下路径视为当前源码树的稳定核心："

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:17
msgid "projects and the graph workbench;"
msgstr "项目和图工作台；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:18
msgid "Dataset, Model, Loss, Optimizer, Trainer, and their typed connections;"
msgstr "Dataset、Model、Loss、Optimizer、Trainer 及其带类型的连接；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:19
msgid "local CPU, MPS, and detected CUDA execution;"
msgstr "本地 CPU、MPS 和检测到的 CUDA 执行；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:20
msgid "configured SSH remote GPU execution;"
msgstr "已配置的 SSH 远程 GPU 执行；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:21
msgid "Observables and their result visualizations;"
msgstr "Observable 及其结果可视化；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:22
msgid "Templates, graph files, and export tiers;"
msgstr "Template、图文件和导出层级；"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:23
msgid "in-repository Node and Observable definition generation."
msgstr "仓库内 Node 和 Observable 定义生成。"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:25
msgid ""
"Stable here means the docs provide a supported learning and reference "
"path. It does not create a semantic-version compatibility promise for an "
"untagged development build."
msgstr "此处的稳定意味着文档提供受支持的学习和参考路径。它并不为未打标签的开发构建作出语义版本兼容性承诺。"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:29
msgid ""
"PVI, LMech, Test, and Architecture IQ were removed ahead of the first "
"release; the pre-removal tree is preserved under the "
"`archive/pre-v1-trim` tag. Apps, Workflows, and the assistant chat were "
"removed later in the same pre-release window: Apps never shipped a panel,"
" chat was already unreachable from the workbench, and the Workflows rail "
"carried a multi-canvas experiment tree whose parameter sweeps are "
"expressed as list-valued node fields on a single canvas instead. The "
"Jekyll blog export hung off that tree and described a sweep as a grid of "
"canvases, so it was removed with it. The LPD curve-phase algorithms "
"remain in the source tree because CurveStarer analysis uses them via "
"`/api/curve-lpd/predict`, and `scripts/graph_report_pdf.py` remains a "
"standalone graph-to-PDF command."
msgstr ""
"PVI、LMech、Test 和 Architecture IQ 已在首次发布前移除；移除前的代码树保存在 "
"`archive/pre-v1-trim` 标签下。Apps、Workflows 和助手 chat 在同一发布前窗口内稍后移除：Apps "
"从未提供面板，chat 已无法从工作台进入，而 Workflows 侧栏承载的是多画布实验树，其参数 sweep "
"现改为在单张画布上用列表值节点字段表达。Jekyll 博客导出依附于该树，并把一次 sweep 描述为画布网格，因此随之一并移除。LPD "
"曲线阶段算法仍保留在源码中，因为 CurveStarer 分析会通过 `/api/curve-lpd/predict` 使用它们；"
"`scripts/graph_report_pdf.py` 仍是独立的图到 PDF 命令。"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:41
msgid "Version path"
msgstr "版本路径"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:43
msgid ""
"This site is published under `/en/dev/` and describes the development "
"source used to build it. It should not retroactively describe older "
"releases. A tagged release should build documentation from that tag and "
"publish it under a distinct version path."
msgstr "本站发布于 `/en/dev/`，描述用于构建它的开发源码。它不应追溯描述旧版本。带标签的发布应从该标签构建文档，并发布到独立的版本路径。"

#: ../../en/reference/support-status.md:48
msgid ""
"When documentation and source disagree, the validated source contract "
"wins for the development build and the documentation should be corrected."
msgstr "当文档与源码不一致时，开发构建以经过验证的源码契约为准，且应修正文档。"
